# Secrets and local env -- never commit. ALL .env variants are blocked with
# no exceptions (no .env.example either). If you need to document expected
# variables, put them in the README, not a committed file. Use GitHub
# Actions secrets for CI and a local untracked file for dev.
.env
.env.*
*.env
secrets.toml
credentials.json
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.keystore

# Editor and IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# OS / misc
*.log
*.bak
.cache/
node_modules/

# Local-only SDS archives (uncomment ONLY if you decide to version-control
# the PDF library on a branch other than main and want a clean main).
# docs/sds/*.pdf

# Shipment artifacts -- NEVER in this repo, on any branch.
#
# A per-shipment PDF carries ship date, quantity, lot number and expiry for
# every line. This repo is PUBLIC: its file tree is browsable on github.com
# and anything ever committed stays in the history permanently, so an opaque
# filename and a robots.txt disallow stop URL-guessing and crawlers, not
# enumeration. Aggregated across shipments that is the whole outbound
# shipping record.
#
# Shipment PDFs are served from the gated endpoint instead. ORS stages them
# to a private directory and refuses, at two layers, to write here.
docs/shipment/
